INSERT INTO blocks (block_id, turn_uuid, turn_no, seq, role, kind, chars, tool_name, tool_use_id, is_error, redacted, signature_sha256, signature_len, privacy_zone, zone_reason, zone_match, text) VALUES (2, 'e7faa287-e373-48d2-80f8-b352853f0621', 1, 1, 'assistant', 'text', 2486, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 'Private work', 'session-internal', '', 'Done. Here''s the field-test result.

## Phase R delivered — traceable, and honest about scope

**Outcome:** your 5 in-session conversations are now atomic notes + a behavioral pattern map + a gap list, saved as markdown and pushed. **Done-when: partial pass** — three artifacts, **zero orphan claims**, all gaps named — but built on **5 conversations, not the ~50 target.** The method works; the batch is short.

**Where it lives:** `agentic-memory/field-test-01/` on your branch → **draft PR #20**.

| File | What it gives you |
|------|-------------------|
| `00-INVENTORY` | what''s present (C1–C5) vs missing |
| `01-ATOMIC-NOTES` | 19 notes, each sourced + confidence-banded |
| `02-PATTERN-MAP` | 5 patterns, ask→intent→outcome deltas, stall points |
| `03-GAP-LIST` | G1–G9 + the fix for each |
| `04-HANDOFF` | handoff card, BigQuery schema mapping, paste-ready Phase P prompt |

## The 3 stall points worth acting on

| Stall | Evidence | One-line fix |
|-------|----------|--------------|
| **"Perfect output" recursion** — corrections with no testable "done," looped 3× | C1 pp.16,21 (N01) | A Done-when test on every task (LOOP OS already does this) |
| **Predictable "Help me visualize this"** — verbatim 2nd move in 3/5 threads | C2,C4,C5 (N03) | Default analysis outputs to "report **+** dashboard" in one pass |
| **Score flips on missing data** — same data/date/formula → 6.7 vs 5.7 | C2 p.8 vs C4 p.20 (N09) | Print "inputs present: X/Y" beside any composite score |

**Confidence in the map: Medium.** Why: each pattern is multiply-sourced, but it''s 5/50 conversations, all health-topic, all one ~2-week window — so "how you do health analysis," not yet "how you think." Generalizing to your legal/other work is **Low** until a diverse batch is added.

## Two things you should know

1. **`send_later` isn''t available** in this session, so I can''t auto-schedule the hourly PR check-in the watcher asked for. CI is not a concern anyway: PR #20 has **no push-triggered CI** (the repo''s only workflows are on-demand Copilot ones) and **no review comments**. Nothing to drive to green. I''ll still react to any webhook event that arrives.
2. **Next move is the batch, not another pass on these five** (anti-resonation). Either add older + non-health conversations and re-run Phase R, or run **Phase P** now in a fresh session using the paste-ready prompt in `04-HANDOFF.md`.

**PASSES** for "prove the pipeline on a sample." Stopping here rather than re-opening the thread.');
