77	### Step 1.4: Chat & Social Media Archives
78	
79	**Best approach: Request official data exports (GDPR/CCPA compliant)**
80	
81	- **WhatsApp**: Settings → Chats → Export Chat (generates `.txt` + media)
82	- **Telegram**: Desktop → Settings → Advanced → Export Telegram Data (JSON/HTML)
83	- **Discord**: Settings → Privacy → Request All of My Data (JSON archive)
84	- **Twitter/X**: Settings → Your Account → Download an Archive (JSON)
85	- **Reddit**: Settings → Request Your Data (CSV/JSON)
