635	## Stage 7: Cross-Platform Memory Sync
636	
637	### Step 7.1: Self-Hosted Shared Memory Server
638	
639	Deploy a single ChromaDB instance that ALL your AI tools connect to:
640	
641	```bash
642	# Deploy ChromaDB
643	docker run -d -p 8000:8000 chromadb/chroma:1.5.9
644	
645	# Secure with Tailscale for cross-device access
646	tailscale up --hostname=memory-server
647	
648	# All AI agents connect via:
649	# http://memory-server.tailnet:8000
650	```
651	
652	### Step 7.2: CLI Memory Interface
653	
654	```bash
