664	
665	### Step 7.3: Cross-Platform Sync Flow
666	
667	```
668	ChromaDB (Source of Truth)
669	    │
670	    ├── → Claude Projects (export top-K relevant docs per project)
671	    ├── → Gemini Gems (sync via GCS bucket)
672	    ├── → Copilot Enterprise (push via Graph Connector API)
673	    ├── → Grok Collections (upload via xAI SDK)
674	    └── → BigQuery (full warehouse backup with embeddings)
675	```
