703	
704	## Supporting Details Table
705	
706	| Dimension | Details | Critical Notes |
707	|-----------|---------|----------------|
708	| **BigQuery URI Format** | `gs://bucket/path/file.jsonl` | Must use `gs://` prefix, no double slashes, wildcards allowed |
709	| **BigQuery Load Command** | `bq load --source_format=NEWLINE_DELIMITED_JSON` | Must be JSONL (one record per line), NOT JSON arrays |
710	| **BigQuery Partitioning** | `--time_partitioning_type=MONTH` | Max 4,000 partitions/table; use MONTH for personal data |
711	| **Claude File Limit** | 30 MB (UI) / 500 MB (API) | Files API is beta; requires `anthropic-beta` header |
712	| **Gemini File Limit** | 2 GB per file (API) | Standard File API expires in 48hrs; use GCS for persistence |
713	| **Copilot Enterprise** | 512 MB per file | Requires E3/E5 + Copilot license; Graph Connector setup |
714	| **Grok Collections** | 100 MB per file | Uses `attachment_search` tool; semantic search built-in |
715	| **Embedding Model Choice** | OpenAI 3072d / Cohere 1024d / Google 768d / Voyage 1024d | Changing models = re-embed entire dataset |
716	| **Chunking Strategy** | Recursive, 512 tokens, 50 token overlap | Semantic chunking best for personal notes |
717	| **Self-Retraining Trigger** | Cosine drift > 0.15 OR importance score change > 20% | Incremental re-index, never full rebuild |
718	| **Cross-Platform Sync** | ChromaDB + Tailscale + CLI | Single source of truth, push to all platforms |
719	| **Feedback Loop** | Accept/reject → importance score ±0.1 | Policy network learns optimal retrieval over time |
720	| **Data Export Formats** | GDPR archives (JSON/CSV), API exports, SQLite queries | Always request official archives first |
721	| **Rate Limits (Critical)** | Notion: 3/sec, Gmail: 250 units/sec, Drive: 1M units/min | Exponential backoff mandatory |
722	| **Authentication** | OAuth 2.0 for Google/Microsoft; API keys for AI platforms | Store in environment variables, never hardcode |
