{
  "document_id": "N27",
  "title": "C8 ends with the same question asked three times in a row; four promised documents were never produced",
  "content": "The mirror image of N01. In N01 he loops because no exit test was defined; here the assistant loops because it will not proceed without one datum. Same failure, opposite direction: **the loop stalls whenever neither side holds a stop rule.** A default-and-flag (\"assuming April 2024 — correct me\") would have delivered four documents.\n\nSource: C8 — the final three assistant turns each request \"the approximate starting month of financial loss.\" Thread ends there. The Legal Memorandum, Affidavit of Fact, Financial Loss Statement and Health Impact Declaration are all promised and absent.\n\nConfidence: High — three identical consecutive requests are visible.\n\nGap: Cannot tell whether he replied and the export dropped it (N21), or the thread genuinely died.",
  "source_type": "chat",
