## What''s in it — 9 sections, dense on purpose

| § | Carries |
|---|---|
| 1–3 | Output protocol · loop shape (Outcome/Done-when/Rounds) · the seven operating rules |
| **4** | **The five fixes, each with its note citations** |
| **5** | **The glossary** — your shorthand decoded |
| 6–7 | Handoff card format · the self-grade |
| 8 | Teaching clause — analogy, one sentence, when you''d use it. No code unless you say so. |
| 9 | Settled: BigQuery, **Watson X deferred**, the Console prompt tools, counts-not-decimals |

## The part that''s new

§4 turns the pattern map into rules with receipts:

| Fix | Receipt |
|---|---|
| **Propose-then-confirm** | 4 documents lost, 5 round-trips, 1 deliverable — N06, N25–N28 |
| **Artefact in the first pass** | Wasted round in 6 of 8 — N03, N24 |
| **Done-when on every task** | "Perfect output" ×3 with no exit — N01, N07 |
| **`inputs present: X/Y`** | 6.7 vs 5.7 on identical data — N09 |
| **Use the glossary** | 2–3 rounds of lag — N02, N08 |

§5 decodes: **audiovisual** = interactive artefact, not prose · **perfect output** = red-team against the test, then *stop* · **cognitive wish** = infer it, state the inference, proceed · **handoff** = card and stop · plus Loop Score and RLN, so those never need re-explaining.

I kept it tight because it enters context every session — brevity there is a running cost, not a style choice.

## Two notes

**It''s markdown, not an artifact.** A PDF can''t function as config. The artifact and PDF are the *deliverables*; this is the machinery.

**One PDF regen went out blank** (working directory reset mid-command) — caught it, rebuilt, amended before push. The 24-page PDF in the repo is correct.

**P8 is now genuinely closed**, not claimed. The stall table says `CLAUDE.md`, not "this repository."

Remaining, all yours: re-export C6–C8 with your turns · the other ~42 conversations · Google Cloud credentials · the `digital` vs `personal` call · PR #20.');
